<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Qara Yuluk Osman</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1435</span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Kara Osman</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Qara Yuluk Osman was the chief of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aq-qoyunlu">Aq Qoyunlu</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turkmen">Turkmen</a> confederation around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/diyarbakir">Diyarbakir</a>. In 1398 he killed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kadi-burhan-al-din">Kadi Burhan al-Din</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sivas">Sivas</a>. He sided with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/timur">Timur</a>, who rewarded him with Diyarbakir, and spent decades fighting the rival Qara Qoyunlu, establishing his tribe as a regional power. He died in battle in 1435.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/qara-yuluk-osman.jpg" alt="Qara Yuluk Osman" width="320" height="158" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 1403-1435 CE · CC BY-SA 2.5 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aq_Qoyunlu._Qara_Y%C3%BCl%C3%BCk_%27Uthman._AH_805-839_1403-1435_CE.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
